      "writtenOn": "2020-06-05T15:12:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "what would be your suggestion on enabling this on build/presubmit? I personally don\u0027t like how in google3 it has a separate macro that people have to put, that leads to issues. I like that it\u0027s part of java_library here!\n\nHowever, should it be an implicitinput for the main output?",
